{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44508","headline":"诗三百三首 二百五 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 二百五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"余家本住在天台，云路烟深绝客来。\n千仞岩峦深可遯，万重谿涧石楼台。\n桦巾木屐沿流步，布裘藜杖绕山回。\n自觉浮生幻化事，逍遥快乐实善哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44508.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44508","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}